    /// &lt;ul>
    ///   &lt;li>English: &lt;pre>&lt;code>I would like a &amp;lt;phoneme alphabet=&amp;quot;ipa&amp;quot; ph=&amp;quot;t&amp;#601;&amp;#712;me&amp;#618;to&amp;#650;&amp;quot;&amp;gt;tomato&amp;lt;/phoneme&amp;gt; please&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/li>
    ///   &lt;li>German: &lt;pre>&lt;code>Ich h&amp;auml;tte gerne ein &amp;lt;phoneme alphabet=&amp;quot;ipa&amp;quot; ph=&amp;quot;&amp;#712;ba&amp;#618;&amp;#643;pi&amp;#720;l&amp;quot;&amp;gt;Beispiel&amp;lt;/phoneme&amp;gt; bitte&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/li>
    /// &lt;/ul>
    /// &lt;p>&lt;b>4b. Arpabet phonemes (glow model only)&lt;/b> - the glow model controls pronunciation with
